ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Me muero por celebrar el {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Tsukimi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
esta noche! {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Me pasaría horas
observando la luna...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}I knew it!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Now we're gonna party
all night with that{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}} big, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}beautiful{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
disco ball of a moon in the sky!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Biliyordum!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} O saçma Ay'dan{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} benim, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}yani,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
ÇOK daha ışıltılı olduğumu anlayacak
kadar zekisin!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Yani,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} o büyük, parlak ve yuvarlak.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:002C:}}
Ama ben büyük, parlak ve güzelim, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}And that's why you're so smart!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
You can totally see the similarities{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
between me and that lovely moon.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}But you don't think I'm all {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}big and
round like the moon,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} do you? {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0008:}}It'd
be {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}SO rude of you to think that!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Evet,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} İKİZ! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Yani,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} ikimizde de bu {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:002C:}}göz
kamaştırıcı güzellik ve parlak aura var,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
değil mi? {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}Bence sadece kıskanıyorsun!
